Package: sync-webdav-desktop
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Mounir IDRASSI <mounir.idrassi@amcrypto.jp>
Homepage: https://github.com/idrassi/sync-webdav-desktop
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1, desktop-file-utils, systemd, util-linux, xdg-utils, pkexec
Recommends: curl, rclone, fuse3, kmod
Description: independent, unofficial Sync.com WebDAV desktop companion
 GTK 3 and Ayatana AppIndicator desktop application for Sync.com WebDAV
 and an rclone-mounted drive. Uses per-user services and browser sign-in.
 The proprietary Sync WebDAV binary is not included. Optional runtime setup
 obtains the vendor installer separately, with explicit user approval.
